{"said":"aura-2-hyperion-en\nIf you want a local language model or embeddings in Java, there are options. They work, though they're often slower than they should be. [pause] But what if you want to flag a fracture on an X-ray for review? Spot defects on a production line? Read a stack of invoices? Isolate the vocals from a track? Or any of a plethora of other capabilities? [pause] Until now, from the JVM, you were stuck. It meant a Python stack, or a tool like Comfy U.I. behind HTTP: another runtime, another process, and a network hop on every call. Fornax calls the native engines directly. No Python, no server, nothing in between.","words":[{"word":"if","start":0.32,"end":0.56},{"word":"you","start":0.56,"end":0.71999997},{"word":"want","start":0.71999997,"end":0.88},{"word":"a","start":0.88,"end":0.96},{"word":"local","start":0.96,"end":1.1999999},{"word":"language","start":1.1999999,"end":1.5999999},{"word":"model","start":1.5999999,"end":2.1599998},{"word":"or","start":2.1599998,"end":2.72},{"word":"embeddings","start":2.72,"end":3.1999998},{"word":"in","start":3.1999998,"end":3.36},{"word":"java","start":3.36,"end":3.9999998},{"word":"there","start":4.08,"end":4.4},{"word":"are","start":4.4,"end":4.56},{"word":"options","start":4.56,"end":5.36},{"word":"they","start":5.6,"end":5.8399997},{"word":"work","start":5.8399997,"end":6.48},{"word":"though","start":6.7999997,"end":6.96},{"word":"they're","start":6.96,"end":7.2799997},{"word":"often","start":7.2799997,"end":7.44},{"word":"slower","start":7.44,"end":7.8399997},{"word":"than","start":7.8399997,"end":8.08},{"word":"they","start":8.08,"end":8.24},{"word":"should","start":8.24,"end":8.4},{"word":"be","start":8.4,"end":8.959999},{"word":"but","start":9.679999,"end":9.92},{"word":"what","start":9.92,"end":10.08},{"word":"if","start":10.08,"end":10.24},{"word":"you","start":10.24,"end":10.32},{"word":"want","start":10.32,"end":10.48},{"word":"to","start":10.48,"end":10.639999},{"word":"flag","start":10.639999,"e